<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;">
    <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
    <p>Hi there,</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your account. Please click the button below to set up a new one:</p>
    <!-- The resetLink variable will be passed from the context attribute -->
    <a href="{{resetLink}}" style="padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">
        Reset Password
    </a>
    <p>Please note: This link is only valid for 15 minutes. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>